  <Widget no="2" caption="check yourself" widget="quiz" config={shotQuizCfg} />
  <p>
    <strong>What to notice:</strong> commit to an answer before revealing the explanation —
    the distractors are the standard misreads (grammar mistaken for natural law, zoom
    treated as dolly, frame shape dismissed as budget). Each explanation shows a convention
    doing deliberate work; if one surprises you, it points to the section to reread.
  </p>
